<urn:atm:triage:finding/RBQA-F002-AI34>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "RBQA-F002-AI34" ;
  triage:title "canonical_graft_root silent config fallback: workspace_root→home_dir with no observability" ;
  triage:description "PR #681 (AI.34 Hermes graft nudge endpoint reconciliation) introduced canonical_graft_root() in crates/atm-core/src/schema/agent_member.rs:53-56 with silent fallback from roster workspace_root to home_dir (via canonical_home_dir) with zero logging/observability distinguishing which branch fired. workspace_root is populated only via manual operator step (atm team update-member --workspace-root, crates/atm-core/src/team_admin/member_mutation.rs:384-389) with no automatic reconciliation to the value an atm-graft session actually runs with. docs/plans/phase-ai/hermes-graft-runbook.md has zero references to update-member/workspace-root, so there's no documented operational step keeping the two in sync. This is the same 'two modules independently answer the same architectural question' pattern that caused the original bug (the bug this PR #681 fixed), just pushed from code to config, with a silent compatibility fallback and no mechanical lint guard. Deprecated compatible_home_dir() exhibits identical silent-fallback pattern on line 62-65 (home_dir→legacy_cwd fallback), even though marked deprecated." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-AI" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
  triage:category "architecture" ;
  triage:severity "important" ;
  triage:repeatable true ;
  triage:sweepScope "workspace" ;
  triage:status "fixed" ;
  triage:closed true ;
  triage:dispatchReady true ;
  triage:closureNote "Fixed via AI.35: canonical_graft_root() (crates/atm-core/src/schema/agent_member.rs:53-73) now logs a structured graft_root_source discriminant (workspace_root/home_dir_fallback/missing) on every branch; compatible_home_dir() (agent_member.rs:79-99) now logs compatible_home_dir_source (home_dir/legacy_cwd_fallback/missing) on every branch. Both fallback branches verified to actually fire via real tracing_subscriber capture-test assertions: canonical_graft_root_logs_workspace_root_and_home_fallback_sources (agent_member.rs:326-347), compatible_home_dir_logs_legacy_fallback_source (agent_member.rs:349-361). Runbook doc (docs/plans/phase-ai/hermes-graft-runbook.md:48-73) documents the update-member --workspace-root operational step with an explicit boundary rationale for keeping reconciliation manual. Verified by AI35-QA-1 (PASS, 6/6, 0 Blocking) via req-qa, arch-qa, and ruthless-boundary-qa (the original filer of this finding)." ;
  triage:closedBy "quality-mgr" ;
  triage:closedAt "2026-07-28T05:50:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:fixCommit "32c5486b1e49fcaf221239ea3cab5a3d284a1f60" ;
